  "StockRole": "Powered Infantry",
  "YangsThoughts": "This was originally the personal Battle Armor of legendary Warrior Bearing Banacek, callsign 'Bearing'.  The <i>'Baracas'</i> is a variation of the Rogue Bear originally designed and produced by Clan Ghost Bear. The <i>'Baracas'</i> is a heavy battlesuit fitted with stealth and heavy VibroClaws  It also comes armed with Battle Armor versions of MicroPulse Lasers and a PPC. It is protected by almost enough armor to stop a Gauss rifle.",
